	(text "Encoder: Bourns PEC11R type, 24 steps per turn with a push switch\n(20 mm shaft, as on Flashover).  No end stops: the LED ring shows the setting.\nA and B have 10k pull-ups and 10n caps (0.1 ms) to smooth contact bounce;\nthe push switch is debounced in firmware.\nHolding the footswitch and pressing the knob at power-up enters recovery mode,\nin place of Flashover's Soft/Hard button.\nAll signals go to the microcontroller on the main board through J8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 114.3 0)
		(effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left))
		(uuid "e28082ee-50b7-436e-8514-56c7fccbdf43")
	)
